<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Accuracy (%) under CDGTD setting. Baselines include: ERM (IncERM), Mixup <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib65" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zhang et al. (2018)</a></cite>, SimCLR <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib6" title="" class="ltx_ref">Chen et al. (2020)</a></cite>, SwAV <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib2" title="" class="ltx_ref">Caron et al. (2020)</a></cite>, EWC <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib22" title="" class="ltx_ref">Kirkpatrick et al. (2017)</a></cite>, SI <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib64" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zenke et al. (2017)</a></cite>, A-GEM <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib5" title="" class="ltx_ref">Chaudhry et al. (2018)</a></cite>, DRAIN <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib60" title="" class="ltx_ref">ying Bai et al. (2022)</a></cite>, EvoS <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib55" title="" class="ltx_ref">Xie et al. (2024c)</a></cite>, and W-Diff <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib54" title="" class="ltx_ref">Xie et al. (2024b)</a></cite>. Best and second-best results are <span id="S3.T2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bolded</span> and <span id="S3.T2.6" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>. For FMoW, CLEAR-10/100, Huffpost and Arxiv, DRAIN is only applied to classifiers due to backbone size limitations. SimCLR and SwAV only apply to image benchmarks. <math id="S3.T2.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\lx@sectionsign}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>§</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\lx@sectionsign}</annotation></semantics></math> indicates TDG baselines.</figcaption>
</figure>
